# **ProveNFix: Temporal Property-Guided Program Repair** **(Artifacts Evaluation)**

[YAHUI SONG, National University of Singapore, Singapore](HTTPS://ORCID.ORG/0000-0002-9760-5895)
[XIANG GAO, Beihang University, China](HTTPS://ORCID.ORG/0000-0001-9895-4600)
